type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"anovaでもok","ts":"1628991128.045800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xPtf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd668d56-6bcb-48bd-b863-1fd430d40443","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"nomikuならキッチンの外で肉の中に熱いれれるので","ts":"1628991126.045600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kkv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11ab3dd2-26bb-4d98-9424-ee91b1488e50","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"人権無視キッチンだと多分一番よいのはnomikuと鉄フライパンかなあ","ts":"1628991113.044800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vzjD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b3b4d91-2e8f-48b9-8bd4-9ce41e85f537","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"人権無視キッチンつらい・・・","ts":"1628991094.044000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bw3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e70a5a8-376e-41ae-92c2-39e87fe05b38","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"量が多いと危険という認識なので量が少ない分には問題ないと自己判断して食べてる (ほとんどすべての食品はだいたい発がん性物質をすこし含んでいる)","ts":"1628991062.043600","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1628991081.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b82C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e59738d3-50d5-4452-9c3a-02c9f75ea9ea","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"やはり置けるならなんとしても置きたいところ","ts":"1628991052.043300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KUF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eeb7fbfb-fb21-4e36-90ba-02c121f83e26","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"塩分もありますね。僕が言及したのは硝酸塩と亜硝酸塩ナトリウムあたりでした。発がん性の疑いがあるやつ","ts":"1628991042.042300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ufoMg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bbb33e8-b3ce-451f-8ee4-813840d6fa8e","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"上の記事は単身者用の人権無視キッチンでどう戦うかみたいな趣旨で書いたのでアレですが","ts":"1628991042.042200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k/SL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcf21a64-4424-4cee-b8f4-644a2de8f0c7","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"置ける余裕があるなら絶対置くべきですねグリル","ts":"1628991012.041200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cSbU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffaefb96-9291-4a3e-95bf-4b0d12a4c040","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そしてグリルいいよなあ....","ts":"1628990947.040400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hf8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6111c336-b19e-46e6-8fb2-2d9dc12c404f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"加工肉...塩分とかなら納得できるものもあるが、他あやしい話題が多すぎてな...\nまあ、普通のバランスで食べるから問題と言われることは気にしない","ts":"1628990930.039800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lX91"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ee4efd2-221a-42e6-9295-7ac0fae37777","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ただステーキは1inch切ると明らかに美味しくないから、ほぼ買わない。","ts":"1628990906.039300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h5Yv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3463bb4c-f845-4442-9b07-a0a5a7d0d80d","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"5cmのやつを一度やってみましたがちょっときつかった","ts":"1628990873.038100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9WoK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08793e0f-4359-4d19-87d7-aa79182ab91d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"3cm未満でもグリルで焼いちゃう。火加減と時間調整しておいとくだけだから。","ts":"1628990872.038000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tGb5M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b363a0a5-872b-41c1-a876-542181c71736","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ただまあ確かにボーダーはそのへんにありそう","ts":"1628990857.037300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Ag"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d09bd137-52af-4120-a033-345e0b607042","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"3cmぐらいまだなら僕ならスキレットでやっちゃうかも","ts":"1628990836.036300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LEcNR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68b72e0b-5f62-4689-ad92-01a65e97cc0e","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"厚みが3cmを大幅に越えるような肉だとグリル必須になっちゃいますね","ts":"1628990818.036000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ph4Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C86CC946-00D7-4F96-A17D-DEFCD44B6BB7","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"レストランだと、グリル→焼くの工程を取ることも多いですよね\n","ts":"1628990788.035500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ber"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d55c4be-142f-4b24-aba2-02c2a7ce7577","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"加工肉の食べすぎは体に悪いが、そもそもタンパク源なので糖質脂質のとりすぎよりは数倍良いと認識してがつがつ食べてます","ts":"1628990755.034600","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1628990774.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U01HFNMNB55"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qkl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96cfb5c5-f1d8-450f-b56e-1e3ea4951ffd","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"僕、ラクシエ使ってるんですけど1万もあったかなあ…","ts":"1628990737.033500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ne4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0b900f1-9186-45de-a612-4dcf471e03ca","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"余談ながら記事で加工肉について言及されているけど、これ、僕も完全に同じ意見です","ts":"1628990733.03