nal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"21ia"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5bed074-a854-4c2a-96fb-0c1736157a9f","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"電子レンジ: 1\nテフロンフライパン: 2\n鉄フライパン: 100","ts":"1628990503.027300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QTly3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e3137bb-ffd3-4f61-9d46-48893da3cc3d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですね、数値で評価すると、","ts":"1628990485.026200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZP0A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"573da8e8-8780-4598-a4d9-dbab374caaed","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"テフロンよりはなると思いますよ。","ts":"1628990474.025800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"edP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"464c0eb9-b22a-43eb-a53b-99868a90540d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ただまあやはり圧倒的にグリルが高性能","ts":"1628990448.025100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c9Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"959c9211-0cbc-4f56-b2fd-3436cdbe931d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"nomiku + skilletもあり。鉄フライパンは個人的にちゃんと経験がないので評価できない・・・","ts":"1628990441.024700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F4b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f9c35d9-3340-44ef-8894-c4c354346b2a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"うーん…僕の調理経験で言えば代替手段になるかと言われたらNoだなぁ。","ts":"1628990395.023300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qzDlV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41d7fa87-43bf-4b06-8dab-14c9b2b44acb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"グリルまたはオーブンですね","ts":"1628990394.023000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K4MD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a667b101-7e35-4a82-aef1-4de4348fccc7","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"立派なグリルつきのコンロがない環境でも鉄フライパンが代替手段になるっていう趣旨の記事ですね","ts":"1628988786.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MFT5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"532a0e08-1de5-4f4e-a1ce-7e59c0750e98","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"塊肉はグリルで焼くのが簡単で一番旨く焼けるよ。","ts":"1628988079.018800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TRLGe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5dda078b-5844-4580-95dd-891558b1669d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"個人的にあまり肉派ではないのだけど(ハンバーグは食べる)これ見ているとスキレットが欲しくなってくるな\n\u003chttps://riq0h.jp/2021/08/14/213845/\u003e","ts":"1628956321.017600","attachments":[{"fallback":"点と接線。: 鉄フライパンで塊肉を焼いて食え - 点と接線。","id":1,"title":"鉄フライパンで塊肉を焼いて食え - 点と接線。","title_link":"https://riq0h.jp/2021/08/14/213845/","text":"「標準メシ」バージョン2.0。改良点はチェダーチーズを上に載せただけだが、はっきり言ってめちゃくちゃうまい。 「標準メシ」朝食バージョン。鉄フライパンで焼いた目玉焼きは白身がカリッとしているのに黄身は半熟のままで最高にうまい。加工肉には様々な問題が指摘されているが、それでも菓子パンなんかを食うよりはずっといい。少なくともタンパク源にはなる。 ステーキ。説明不要のうまさ。 前回の続き。メニューそのものに大","thumb_url":"https://riq0h.jp/siteicon.png","blocks":null,"ts":1628944725,"service_name":"点と接線。","service_icon":"https://riq0h.jp/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":900,"thumb_height":900,"from_url":"https://riq0h.jp/2021/08/14/213845/","original_url":"https://riq0h.jp/2021/08/14/213845/"}],"edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1628956334.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"umasou","count":1,"users":["U01J8RHFH3P"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vcY+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fabcf5f-5965-441b-90a9-88d5233e07e4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そういえばこの前メシテロされて以来念願だったみょうが乗せそうめんを食べました(写真忘れた)","ts":"162